{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#card-zh","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 是一款面向 DSH 的 PDF 翻译插件，适合需要阅读外文论文并保留原始排版的用户。它在 DSH 注册 PDF 翻译工具和配置命令，由本机 BabelDOC 程序处理一个或多个 PDF，可指定语言、页码、输出目录、术语表和翻译选项，并生成双语对照版或纯译文版及运行日志。用户可以查询运行状态、设置接口和模型、保存或清除 API 密钥。首次使用需准备 Python 运行环境、下载模型字体，并提供 OpenAI 兼容接口的 API 密钥；默认接口为 DeepSeek。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:422-452","index.js:453-516","index.js:532-590","index.js:643-714"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#card-en","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh translates PDFs in DSH with local BabelDOC. Choose languages, pages, output folder and glossary, then receive bilingual or translated files and a log. A command manages runtime, model and API key. Setup needs Python, model assets and an OpenAI-compatible key; DeepSeek is the default.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:422-452","index.js:453-516","index.js:532-590","index.js:643-714"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#feature-1","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 的「版式保留 PDF 翻译」功能：通过工具提交 PDF 文件后调用本机 BabelDOC，并返回双语对照版或纯译文版的路径与日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:447-452","index.js:406-419"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#feature-2","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 的「选择翻译范围」功能：提交一个或多个 PDF，可指定源语言、目标语言、页码范围及输出目录，生成的文件可分别为双语版或纯译文版。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:453-484","index.js:561-581"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#feature-3","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 的「配置与状态管理」功能：在 DSH 输入 /babeldoc 命令查看运行时、资源和接口状态，也可设置或清除 API Key、切换模型及兼容接口地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:643-714"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#feature-4","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 的「术语表和翻译选项」功能：翻译工具可接收术语表 CSV，并设置水印、表格文本翻译、版式兼容选项和请求速率上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:471-484","index.js:595-620"]}
{"unit_id":"Alex-yuanli__babeldoc-on-dsh#caveat-1","repo":"Alex-yuanli/babeldoc-on-dsh","commit":"75312f81335e5ddc187cbf98cf34f06b142fcda4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BabelDoc-on-dsh 使用前须知：翻译 PDF 会交给配置的 OpenAI 兼容接口处理，默认是 api.deepseek.com；需自备 API Key 并承担接口用量。见 index.js:430-440, 555-559。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:430-440","index.js:555-559"]}
